06.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z'/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3659321428571427em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485007em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;\">∑</span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">[</span></span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3280857142857143em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord overline mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6755600000000002em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.57756em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"minner mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3280857142857143em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.03588em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord overline mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6755600000000002em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.57756em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.19444em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8296em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>可问题是上课时老师只是带我们简单看了一下推导过程，我们都没在意。结果想不到高考居然真的这么弄了！不过好在之后我去仔细看了一下求和符号，至少现在不会太担心了。😏</p>\n<h3 id=\"誓师大会距离2023高考还有363天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#誓师大会距离2023高考还有363天\">#</a> 誓师大会 — 距离 2023 高考还有 363 天</h3>\n<p>2022 年 6 月 10 日，高考假期结束后的第三天，学校举行了高三誓师大会，同时也标志着高三生涯正式开始了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高二期末考试距离2023高考还有345天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#高二期末考试距离2023高考还有345天\">#</a> 高二期末考试–距离 2023 高考还有 345 天</h3>\n<p>2022 年 6 月 27~29 日</p>\n<p>期末考试就是市统测，但是卷子出的很有问题！被不少人批判……</p>\n<p>考试结束后 (6 月 30 号), 我们班的 6 科老师竟然要换掉 4 个！虽然原因有各种各样的 (比如刚刚来学校，带不了高三、因为某些原因离职等等)，但都跟我们班的那群 “神仙” 们脱离不了干系！(#｀-_ゝ -)</p>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cbx_0\" disabled=\"true\"><label for=\"cbx_0\"> 数学老师走前留下的一段话 —— 从高尔顿板、正态分布到我们的未来</label></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"七月~十一月\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#七月~十一月\">#</a> 七月～十一月</h2>\n<h3 id=\"暑期补习距离2023高考还有336天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#暑期补习距离2023高考还有336天\">#</a> 暑期补习–距离 2023 高考还有 336 天</h3>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cbx_1\" disabled=\"true\"><label for=\"cbx_1\"> 等待补充</label></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"开学距离2023高考还有280天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#开学距离2023高考还有280天\">#</a> 开学–距离 2023 高考还有 280 天</h4>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cbx_2\" disabled=\"true\"><label for=\"cbx_2\"> 等待补充</label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"运动会距离高考还有251天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#运动会距离高考还有251天\">#</a> 运动会–距离高考还有 251 天</h3>\n<p>百日已逝，但是发现自己却是没什么作为！</p>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cbx_3\" disabled=\"true\"><label for=\"cbx_3\"> 等待补充</label></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"十二月\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#十二月\">#</a> 十二月</h2>\n<h3 id=\"疫情居家网课距离高考还有188天\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#疫情居家网课距离高考还有188天\">#</a> 疫情居家网课–距离高考还有 188 天</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>逝者如斯夫，不舍昼夜。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>没想到初三暑假降临的疫情如今卷土重来，气势汹汹！11 月 21 日被通知线上授课，本以为自己能够通过这次机遇提升一番，但事与愿违，自己还是在漫无目的的游荡，不知方向，晕头转向！🙄</p>\n<ul class=\"task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cbx_4\" disabled=\"true\"><label for=\"cbx_4\"> 补充学校每日安排</label></li>\n</ul>\n<p>+++</p>\n<p><s>喂，哪来 11 月 31 日的？？？</s></p>\n<p>12.1: 明天早读英语背诵第三单元前半部分单词，有时间再写 45 套。</p>\n<p>+++</p>\n",
